risks[3]:
  - Conservative deletion refuses an owned recorded release whose live member/parent proof is insufficient; it preserves membership until safe repair instead of treating receipt as current deletion authority.
  - Lock/journal implementation still needs proposed failure injection and concurrency evidence; this plan revision is not execution or verification of the algorithm.
  - Qualified native library ABI verification remains separate from offline management-flow stubs, unchanged from plan0.1.
